    <!-- MuMa Voice: the parsed request shown under the microphone -->
    <string name="voice.title">Voice commands</string>
    <string name="voice.text"><![CDATA[Ask the Assistant in the car, or use the voice search of the app. Everything below can be combined in one sentence.\n\n<b>A genre</b>\nPlay genre hardstyle\nPlay uptempo hardcore\nPlay drum and bass livesets\n\n<b>An artist</b>\nPlay music by headhunterz\nPlay artist brennan heart\n\n<b>A label</b>\nPlay label art of creation\n\n<b>A set</b>\nPlay a set\nPlay a Defqon set\nPlay the latest set of headhunterz\n\n<b>Live sets, DJ sets or podcasts</b>\nPlay livesets\nPlay livesets from Defqon 2019\nPlay dj sets by headhunterz\nPlay podcasts\nA live set files under the year it was played.\n\n<b>A podcast show</b>\nPlay the Keeping The Rave Alive podcast\nPlay the podcast KTRA\nPlay the latest episode of Monstercat\nThe show plays newest episode first. A name the library does not know as a show still plays podcasts.\n\n<b>A year</b>\nPlay hardstyle from 2021\nPlay headhunterz from 2020\n\n<b>An order</b>\nPlay random hardcore\nPlay recent\nPlay recently added\n\n<b>Your favourites</b>\nPlay favourites\nPlay favourites by headhunterz\nPlay favourites from 2021\n\n<b>All of it at once</b>\nPlay random favourites from 2023\nPlay random uptempo hardcore from 2021\n\n<b>Later in the queue</b>\nPlay project one next\nPlay dragonborn after this\n\n<b>An album, a playlist or a title</b>\nPlay album thunderdome\nPlay the playlist zomer\nPlay the track dragonborn\n\n<b>A rating</b>\nPlay hardstyle with at least 4 stars\n\n<b>A quality</b>\nPlay flac hardstyle\nPlay hardcore in high quality\n\n<b>More than one of a kind</b>\nPlay hardstyle en hardcore\nPlay hardstyle from 2020 en 2021\n\nA name has to be one the library knows. What it cannot place is dropped and the rest of the request still plays; when it can place nothing at all, the ordinary search takes over and looks for the title.\n\nThe microphone in the toolbar opens MuMa Voice, which understands all of the above and can ask which one you meant when a name fits several things. About > Voice diagnostics shows exactly what every request did.]]></string>

